usage: whats_hot_tool [-h] [--base BASE] [--dry-run] [--hot-path HOT_PATH]
                      {write,read,status} ...

Deterministic _hot.md prepend-only manager with sentinel separation and
indexed retrieval

positional arguments:
  {write,read,status}
    write              prepend a new hot entry
    read               retrieve one or more hot entries
    status             show _hot.md summary

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --base BASE          DIL base path (default: auto-resolve)
  --dry-run            preview without side effects
  --hot-path HOT_PATH  override path to _hot.md (default:
                       {base}/_shared/_hot.md)
